#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:52
msgid ""
"OAK: Oh, for Pete's sake…\n"
"So pushy, as always.\p"
"{B_PLAYER_NAME}.\p"
"You've never had a POKéMON battle\n"
"before, have you?\p"
"A POKéMON battle is when TRAINERS\n"
"pit their POKéMON against each\l"
"other.\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：唉，真是的……\n"
"还是那么性急。\p"
"{B_PLAYER_NAME}。\p"
"你还从来没有进行过\n"
"宝可梦对战吧？\p"
"宝可梦对战就是训练家\n"
"让各自的宝可梦\l"
"互相战斗。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:53
msgid ""
"OAK: Hm…\n"
"How disappointing…\p"
"If you win, you earn prize money,\n"
"and your POKéMON grow.\p"
"But if you lose, {B_PLAYER_NAME}, you end\n"
"up paying prize money…\p"
"However, since you had no warning\n"
"this time, I'll pay for you.\p"
"But things won't be this way once\n"
"you step outside these doors.\p"
"That's why you must strengthen your\n"
"POKéMON by battling wild POKéMON.\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：嗯……\n"
"真令人失望……\p"
"如果你赢了，就能获得奖金，\n"
"你的宝可梦也会成长。\p"
"但如果你输了，{B_PLAYER_NAME}，\n"
"你就得支付奖金……\p"
"不过，这次你事先不知情，\n"
"就由我来替你付吧。\p"
"但你一旦走出这扇门，\n"
"事情就不会这样了。\p"
"所以你必须和野生宝可梦对战，\n"
"锻炼你的宝可梦。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:54
msgid ""
"OAK: Inflicting damage on the foe\n"
"is the key to any battle.\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：对战的关键\n"
"就是给对手造成伤害。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:55
msgid ""
"OAK: Keep your eyes on your\n"
"POKéMON's HP.\p"
"It will faint if the HP drops to\n"
"“0.”\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：注意你的宝可梦的\n"
"HP。\p"
"如果HP降到“0”，\n"
"宝可梦就会濒死。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:56
msgid ""
"OAK: Lowering the foe's stats\n"
"will put you at an advantage.\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：降低对手的能力，\n"
"能让你处于有利地位。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:57
msgid ""
"OAK: No! There's no running away\n"
"from a TRAINER POKéMON battle!\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：不行！和训练家的\n"
"宝可梦对战是不能逃跑的！\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:58
msgid ""
"The TRAINER that makes the other\n"
"TRAINER's POKéMON faint by lowering\l"
"their HP to “0,” wins.\p"
msgstr ""
"让对方训练家的宝可梦\n"
"HP降到“0”而濒死的\l"
"训练家就是胜者。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:59
msgid ""
"But rather than talking about it,\n"
"you'll learn more from experience.\p"
"Try battling and see for yourself.\p"
msgstr ""
"不过与其听我讲，\n"
"不如亲身体验学得更多。\p"
"试着对战一下，亲眼看看吧。\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:60
msgid ""
"OAK: Hm! Excellent!\p"
"If you win, you earn prize money,\n"
"and your POKéMON will grow!\p"
"Battle other TRAINERS and make\n"
"your POKéMON strong!\p"
msgstr ""
"大木：嗯！很好！\p"
"如果你赢了，就能获得奖金，\n"
"你的宝可梦也会成长！\p"
"和其他训练家对战，\n"
"让你的宝可梦变强吧！\p"

#: src/battle_controller_oak_old_man.c:61
msgid ""
"What will the\n"
"old man do?"
msgstr ""
"老爷爷要\n"
"怎么做？"
